e4946bdc1b9d54cd272dac39f81f.avif?t=1750784422\" width=618 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A key feature of the game is its built-in ecosystem for speedrun fans. You can track your completion time for each room and overall progress directly during gameplay. This allows you to analyze your actions, refine your tactics, and compete against yourself. It adds challenges for the fastest and most agile players, making every second crucial in your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480850/extras/c67bd4f9f94d90b6cc0e839b0bb891da.poster.avif?t=1750784422\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480850/extras/c67bd4f9f94d90b6cc0e839b0bb891da.webm?t=1750784422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480850/extras/c67bd4f9f94d90b6cc0e839b0bb891da.mp4?t=1750784422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has no storyline, you need to go through six rooms and an island to find a boat and escape. The enemy will keep you constantly on edge, while the speedrun timer relentlessly tracks your run. This game is perfect for activating your brain, hanging out with friends, and competing for the best result.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480850/extras/af164a245ea962e028c6e6e4f3e14e42.avif?t=1750784422\" data-has-big width=800 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;After the death of your father, the king, traitors stripped you of your right to inherit and imprisoned you on the Isle of Exile in